<title>UK: LME TOPSY-TURVY IN PM, MOST END EASIER.</title>
<headline>LME TOPSY-TURVY IN PM, MOST END EASIER.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Snaps up in late trade from lows, closes with small gains. Still vulnerable on downside.</p>
<p>ZINC - Closes lower under $1,500, backwardations contract significantly on talk of Chinese deliveries.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Regains $1,700, still soft. NICKEL - Ends easier. LEAD - Finishes under $600. TIN - Closes weak.</p>
</text>
